  note        = {Verified against the full 41-page text of J3016\_202104 (Issued 2014-01, Revised 2021-04, Superseding J3016 JUN2018). IMPORTANT ACCURACY FINDING: a full-text search of J3016\_202104 returns NO occurrence of 'securement', 'cargo', 'refuel' or 'charging'. The standard does NOT enumerate cargo or passenger securement, refuelling or charging as DDT exclusions, and 'diagnostics' is not used; vehicle repair and maintenance appears only inside the definition of fleet operations (3.13), not as a stated DDT exclusion. Those commonly repeated items were therefore deliberately omitted from Section 4 rather than asserted. Revision check performed 13 August 2026 via the SAE Mobilus revisions panel, which lists J3016\_202104 (2021-04-30) as current and J3016\_201806, J3016\_201609 and J3016\_201401 as historical.}
